| CP1 | census-1000.jpg | 1000 ms | 10.0 | dc9cb43608172082e61f5e171f4892f58cf9393754fa0b18c9edee42ce85f972 | Blade vertical, edge in contact with the shell's right side; object still upright, grip tightened; NO flesh visible. |
