| CP3 | census-3000.jpg | 3000 ms | 12.0 | 891976828438a686495dcad4ad1833a78a21200f3cbf9a62ef82d040b1ef51d9 | Blade deep through the equator; bright green flesh EXTRUDING along the cut on both sides of the blade — flesh reveal in progress, pass not yet complete. |
