- Purity: guards cmd1 grep `segment\.mp4|source\.mp4|<video|<img|dNJdJIwCF_Y` → 0 hits in recreation.html; external-reference scan (`src=|href=|@import|url(`) → none (SVG namespace identifier excepted, classified); asset inventory = recreation.html alone.
- Comparison check pass conditions: both labels present verbatim · handle-offset mapping evaluates (video 3.0 s → build 2500 ms) · `@media (max-width:560px)` stacking present · comparison script `node --check` rc=0.
- A6 legs: fit-table.md — the recreation carries NO subject text (verified by grep); the fit leg therefore files zero subject-text rows with that verification as its evidence, plus PIL rendered measurement (stand-in DejaVu Sans) of the comparison page's two labels at 360 px as the only text the deliverable shows. config-census.md — all literals classified; every CONFIG key incl. nested `outer`/`inner`/`palette` keys resolved to value-flowing sites; CSS-variable check (none used).
- jev-prewave after legs 1–3 + A6, payload per its contract (A6 outputs verbatim, A10.1); five-lens wave only on FIRE-WAVE; bar avg ≥85, min ≥70.

### 2.5 Failure points (priced)
- Stepped-vs-smooth saw: if the saw renders smooth, the stop-motion character (the packet's named mechanic) is lost — the step quantization is in stateAt itself, asserted by P2's sawStep value.
- Flesh timing: flesh before the onset fraction, or only at completion, both falsify the census (extrusion is progressive in the late saw) — P2/P3/C@3000 price exactly this.
- Identity legibility: generated shapes are schematic — if the shell segmentation or the bright flesh does not read at phone size, readability/motion lenses will price it; the construction's defence is the strong dark-shell vs bright-flesh contrast + the seam hold.
- Deferred (named, lawful): the two background grenades + plate dressing, the bowl at top, photoreal hand anatomy (hands are shapes by the purity charge — generated construction, never traced), the twist-apart + pit (T228, next technique, outside the window).
- Render-proof limitation: no browser binary in this seat — PIXEL-UNVERIFIED carried to scores.md; comparison page is the render surface.
- Plateau (A2): FIRST ATTEMPT — no prior average. **Predicted minimum lens: motion fidelity** — hypothesis: schematic generated shapes vs photographic stop-motion is the largest fidelity gap; timing is census-anchored and purity is construction-guaranteed, so motion (shape fidelity) is where the score concentrates its loss. If the wave's minimum is elsewhere, scores.md's WHY names the actual stuck lens.

